        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Multi-Zone Heating Failures</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">30 min response</span></div>
          <p>Large Woolton homes often have two or three heating zones, multiple motorised valves, separate thermostats. More components means more things that can fail. We diagnose properly before swapping parts. A wrong call on a big system is expensive.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Unvented Cylinder Faults</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">30 min response</span></div>
          <p>Mains pressure cylinders feed multiple bathrooms across a detached home. When the immersion or thermostat fails, the whole house loses hot water. We're G3 qualified and carry common spares.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Premium Fixture Repairs</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">30 min response</span></div>
