        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Period Property Drain Issues</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">30 min response</span></div>
          <p>Long clay drain runs under large Woolton gardens. Root intrusion. Ground movement cracking. Both common in older properties. We run a CCTV survey if it keeps blocking. We clear with high-pressure jetting.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Boiler Breakdowns in Conservation Area Homes</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">30 min response</span></div>
